# =====================================================================
# 5. Security-critical paths.
#
# Changes to anything in this section must be reviewed by an operator
# with security context: the authorization engine, the certificate
# enrollment surface, the TLS verifier, the SPIFFE workload-identity
# integration, the per-tenant quota tracker, the encrypted-archive key
# ring, the hash-chained audit log, the audit event vocabulary itself,
# the workspace secret-file reader, the PII-masking helpers, and the
# federation JWT / JWKS authentication plane.
#
# These are the highest-risk files in the workspace because a defect
# here either weakens the trust boundary (identity, authz, mTLS) or
# weakens the forensic record (audit, masking, encrypted archive). They
# are listed individually after the whole-crate rules above so that
# CODEOWNERS' last-match-wins behaviour routes them through this section
# rather than through the broader crate ownership.
# =====================================================================

# Authorization engine — RBAC/ABAC, Cedar backend, PEP boundary.
crates/rustgate-authz/                             @rchiofalo

# Certificate enrollment — PKCS#12, EST (RFC 7030), CSR signing oracle.
crates/rustgate-enrollment/                        @rchiofalo

# Transport — TLS verifier, cert reloader, SPIFFE SVID, tenant quota.
crates/rustgate-transport/src/verifier.rs          @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-transport/src/cert_reloader.rs     @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-transport/src/spiffe.rs            @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-transport/src/quota.rs             @rchiofalo

# Core — encrypted archive key ring, hash-chained audit log, audit
# event vocabulary, secret-file reader, PII masking helpers.
crates/rustgate-core/src/encrypted.rs              @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-core/src/audit_chain.rs            @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-core/src/audit.rs                  @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-core/src/secrets.rs                @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-core/src/masking.rs                @rchiofalo

# Federation — JWT authority + JWKS client (federation auth plane).
crates/rustgate-federation/src/jwt.rs              @rchiofalo
crates/rustgate-federation/src/jwks_client.rs      @rchiofalo
